{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/extras/044a45b891a1b7aaa6e5f64a05367a47.poster.avif?t=1761747958\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/extras/044a45b891a1b7aaa6e5f64a05367a47.webm?t=1761747958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/extras/044a45b891a1b7aaa6e5f64a05367a47.mp4?t=1761747958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Roll the dice and raise your bloodline!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic tabletop games meet roguelite elements and card-based combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious fantasy worlds, hand-drawn 2D art, old-school board game systems, genetic randomness, tactical turn-based battles, and the constant feeling that your next roll might just be your last\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The features of this game are:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dice-based exploration system on a procedurally generated board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battles using a growing deck of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodline-based hero creation: breed, combine traits, and evolve your lineage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A village that grows with you \u2014 unlock buildings, gain backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath and permanent legacy: every run matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight deadly regions with unique threats and atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D dark fantasy visuals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/extras/b91df95b04187606eecb718bfbbb9273.poster.avif?t=1761747958\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/extras/b91df95b04187606eecb718bfbbb9273.webm?t=1761747958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/extras/b91df95b04187606eecb718bfbbb9273.mp4?t=1761747958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect in the demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is just a small glimpse of what\u2019s to come in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You\u2019ll be able to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create heroes from a pool of randomized parents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the first region of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies using the turn-based card system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock basic village buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core loop of exploration, combat, breeding, and legacy-building</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a taste not the whole feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature more regions, enemies, buildings, traits, and game-changing cards to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more detailed information, please visit the Boardlike store page.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088020?t=1761747958","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/38cd9e57940787bb7ea71cd7a911c470a4f8bece/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761747958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/34d77aa3a65ff27a20f5e0bb76d70593ca32b366/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761747958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088020/34d77aa3a65ff27a20f5e0bb76d70593ca32b366/capsule_184x69